    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d90">

                <pb facs="0193" n="77" xml:id="pg77"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American
                        Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 5, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Compliance with the request of the Chinese Foreign Minister referred to in your
                    April 4 does not involve formal recognition; it would be in harmony with our de
                    facto relations with the present administration. You may instruct consuls to
                    comply, with this understanding.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
